OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry around Belfast and
OL,6,Fthe east with bright spells, feeling
OL,7,Fpleasant in any sunshine. Cloudy in
OL,8,Fthe west with outbreaks of rain, then
OL,9,Frain occasionally heavy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe rain pushing east during
OL,12,Fthis evening, turning light and
OL,13,Fpatchy. Mainly dry with clear spells
OL,14,Fovernight with a touch of frost
OL,15,Fpossible, although a few showers in
OL,16,Fthe west.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FIt will be a mainly dry and
OL,19,Fbright day with sunny spells, perhaps
OL,20,Fthe odd light shower. Light northwest
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
