OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,7,Fpressure dominates. Chilly nights if
OL,8,Fskies remain clear with a frost
OL,9,Fpossible along with some mist and fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
